  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the core work of IUCN SSC&apos;s African Rhino Specialist Group&apos;s Secretariat at a time of extreme pressures on African rhino populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will support a portion of the core services provided by the Secretariat of the IUCNs African Rhino Specialist Group including compiling continental data for the Convention on International Trade in Endangered Species (CITES) and other meetings, providing impartial advise to range states, and maintaining timely communications among range states and experts on emerging issues.</narrative>
  </description>
